          <h1>Regulation of <span class="gradient-text">Gene Silencing</span> by RNA & Chromatin</h1>
          <p class="hero-description">
            We are a structural biology group at the University of Colorado Boulder. Using advanced cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM), cryo-electron tomography (cryo-ET), and biochemistry, we characterize the molecular machinery governing transcriptional repression, gene silencing, and higher-order chromosome architecture.
          </p>
          <div class="button-group">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="document.querySelector('[data-target=research]').click();" id="hero-btn-explore">Explore Our Research</button>
